  "title": "Gorilla Announces Delivery of CVR Payment Notice",
  "summary": "London, United Kingdom–(Newsfile Corp. – July 17, 2026) – Gorilla Technology Group Inc. (NASDAQ: GRRR) (“Gorilla”) today announced that each holder of Gorilla’s Class A contingent value rights and Class B contingent value rights (together, “CVRs”) will be entitled to a distribution of Gorilla ordinary shares, subject to restrictions provided for in the Contingent Value Rights Agreement […] The post Gorilla Announces Delivery of CVR Payment Notice appeared first on Gorilla Technology .",
